WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 1 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:45.260
chosen by the dragons.

2
00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:48.260
What was that floor sweeper trying to scrub the sky?

3
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:51.380
Charity case playing dragon rider.

4
00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.820
The only thing you'll ever mount is that splintered-ass

5
00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.980
broom orphan.

6
00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.340
I'm the headmaster's attendant.

7
00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.100
I have actual work to do.

8
00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.980
So if you'll excuse me.

9
00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:01.860
Hey, nice boys.

10
00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:09.130
Harris wants to see a dragon up close.

11
00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:15.610
Let's give him a front row seat.

12
00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:17.970
Damn, your beast just doesn't take you seriously,

13
00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:20.210
Cinder, heal!

14
00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:21.210
Right damn now!

15
00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:35.340
Burn his hair.

16
00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:37.780
Why am I always your punching bag?

17
00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:52.960
I never did a damn thing to you!

18
00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.160
Class, and you can't even roast a janitor!

19
00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:57.640
Wait, what just happened?

20
00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:00.880
So being disliked by dragons actually works as a shield.

21
00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:04.120
You useless lizard!

22
00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:19.630
Whatever.

23
00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:24.840
Better clean this mess up before Mr. Thorn gets back.

24
00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:47.620
It's the least I can do to repay his kindness.

25
00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:48.980
Still sleeping?

26
00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.100
All dragons despise and avoid me,

27
00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:53.100
but luckily you're just an egg.

28
00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.140
We're both left in the dark to be forgotten.

29
00:02:55.140 --> 00:03:08.060
Do you think someone like us could ever be a hero?

30
00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:10.940
I buried this secret for 20 years,

31
00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:14.540
but the dragon god's chosen doesn't just disappear, does he?

32
00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:20.600
His blood is waking up.

33
00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.040
If the council senses this power...

34
00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:23.920
Where did the blood go?

35
00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:27.360
They'll strip me of my title and hand the academy to him.

36
00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:31.740
Wait, hey, no, no, no!

37
00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:32.860
At least don't break!

38
00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:34.700
Over my dead body.
